      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Most NTM ores are placed by the Custom Ore Generation mod in large veins. Check the Guide Book table for their heights. Besides the ore veins, the ground hides a few other things:\n\n- §6Resource layers§r - big 3D patches of §6Hematite§r, §6Malachite§r and §6Bauxite§r, plus §6Limestone§r veins. Iron, copper and aluminium in bulk.\n- §6Sulfur caves§r with sulfurous stone and pools of sulfuric acid, and §6asbestos caves§r full of Chrysotile. Do not mine the latter without a mask.\n- §6Gas pockets§r between Y 30 and 40. §cFlammable gas§r ignites from fire, lava or a torch, §cexplosive gas§r blows up. Do not carry torches into caves full of it.\n- §6Alexandrite Ore§r - a rare gem between Y 10 and 15, which only Mining Charges can break.\n- §6Tar Sand§r fields in deserts, a source of bitumen.\n- Natural §6Sellafite§r craters in deserts - highly radioactive.",
